--- docs ---
### /app/routenote/BAKE.txt
tblbake argv: RECIPE OUTDIR. Writes quarrel.lst then action.tbl, goto.tbl, prod.tbl when the mill accepts the recipe.
### /app/routenote/MILL.txt
tblbake reads card.yg and writes tblwell tables. ribjoin walks reduce numbers from prod.tbl.

Flat cards under /app/flatpit are the mill's own walk. Green status there does not prove nested clip placement.
### /app/routenote/WALK.txt
boot.rs includes cursor.rs. sift tokenizes a quern file, drives action.tbl, and writes the destination object.
### /app/drawbin/FRONT.txt
drawbin is the sift front.
--- grammar ---
     1	# rib_b
     2	S : YARD ID LBRACE MS RBRACE ;
     3	MS : MS M | ;
     4	M : PEG ID EQ VAL SEMI
     5	  | PEN ID LBRACE MS RBRACE
     6	  | PEN ID LBRACE MS RBRACE CLIP ID
     7	  | CLIP ID
     8	  ;
